; Test 02: typing + save.  TOP, typing at column 0 of line 0, then Return
; and two more lines: keywords, string, ';' comment, '$' hex, Tab.  TED's
; Return does not split: it opens a new line below (observed in R5 and C5,
; stage 1 session C), so the first text goes in front of the old line 0.
; Saved file = tedsrc tok of the expected text incl. the empty last line
; (checked on the host).  Compared: saved file A<->B, dumps.
; @source T t01_int
; @est 9
; @expect tok t01_int.bb2 02-type.expect
; @expect bak t01_int.bb2.bak
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 2 0
type "NPrint \"Hi\" ;c\n"
type "x.l=$1F : y=x*2\n"
type "\tNPrint x\n"
dump typed
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
